{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32395","headline":"晚坐寄友人 · 温庭筠","name":"晚坐寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九枝灯在琐窗空，希逸无聊恨不同。\n晓梦未离金夹膝，早寒先到石屏风。\n遗簪可惜三秋白，蜡烛犹残一寸红。\n应卷鰕帘看皓齿，镜中惆怅见梧桐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}